          "table": null,
          "text": "In addition, Google Services generates revenues from products and services beyond advertising, including:",
          "text_hash": "b1521a490872d564cbed15ae19081309d0df87b94f8a93d66b3c6b61cddadbe9",
          "type": "paragraph"
        },
        {
          "block_id": "block-000093-9da7e695",
          "dom_path": "/html/body/div[105]",
          "image_asset_id": null,
          "layout_role": null,
          "ordinal": 93,
          "reported_page": 5,
          "source_anchor": "i6be430fe3ebf411481dcec8b0abe9149_19",
          "style_signature": {
            "font-family": "'arial',sans-serif",
            "font-size": "10pt",
            "font-weight": "400",
            "line-height": "120%",
            "margin-top": "6pt",
            "padding-left": "36pt",
            "text-align": "justify",
            "text-indent": "-18pt"
          },
          "table": null,
          "text": "•consumer subscriptions, which primarily include revenues from YouTube services, such as YouTube TV, YouTube Music and Premium, and NFL Sunday Ticket, as well as Google One, which offers access to our most capable Gemini models;",
          "text_hash": "9da7e695e75792ccb77496ce6528f9a735ca57113629e471e47e4af14227ba13",
          "type": "paragraph"
        },
        {
          "block_id": "block-000094-0a4cdc1c",
          "dom_path": "/html/body/div[106]",
          "image_asset_id": null,
          "layout_role": null,
          "ordinal": 94,
          "reported_page": 5,
          "source_anchor": "i6be430fe3ebf411481dcec8b0abe9149_19",
          "style_signature": {
