            "padding-left": "36pt",
            "text-align": "justify",
            "text-indent": "-18pt"
          },
          "table": null,
          "text": "•platforms, which primarily include revenues from Google Play sales of apps and in-app purchases; and",
          "text_hash": "0a4cdc1c763c73b2db10d77e076c3457f5e4fce9abaebfba2a938f21c6a0b541",
          "type": "paragraph"
        },
        {
          "block_id": "block-000095-50fe9352",
          "dom_path": "/html/body/div[107]",
          "image_asset_id": null,
          "layout_role": null,
          "ordinal": 95,
          "reported_page": 5,
          "source_anchor": "i6be430fe3ebf411481dcec8b0abe9149_19",
          "style_signature": {
            "font-family": "'arial',sans-serif",
            "font-size": "10pt",
            "font-weight": "400",
            "line-height": "120%",
            "margin-top": "6pt",
            "padding-left": "36pt",
            "text-align": "justify",
            "text-indent": "-18pt"
          },
          "table": null,
          "text": "•devices, which primarily include sales of the Pixel family of devices.",
          "text_hash": "50fe93522a4adc497ba0486614d6f1665b3782b44894f1aecdb9adbf2f771fd5",
          "type": "paragraph"
        },
        {
          "block_id": "block-000096-69bd2211",
