            "font-weight": "400",
            "line-height": "120%",
            "margin-top": "6pt",
            "padding-left": "36pt",
            "text-align": "justify",
            "text-indent": "-18pt"
          },
          "table": null,
          "text": "•AI-optimized Infrastructure: runs on our Cloud, at the edge, or in customers' data centers. It can be used to migrate and modernize information technology (IT) systems and to train and serve various types of AI models. Our AI infrastructure delivers cost-performance for AI workloads. We offer a range of AI accelerators, including our custom TPUs and specialized GPUs, as well as AI-optimized storage offerings, and efficient AI software.",
          "text_hash": "d537716dd765de196c08e5854e0692c20b8d935f12b34cf73244b09f3c8fa5f4",
          "type": "paragraph"
        },
        {
          "block_id": "block-000101-5f81eec2",
          "dom_path": "/html/body/div[113]",
          "image_asset_id": null,
          "layout_role": null,
          "ordinal": 101,
          "reported_page": 6,
          "source_anchor": "i6be430fe3ebf411481dcec8b0abe9149_19",
          "style_signature": {
            "font-family": "'arial',sans-serif",
            "font-size": "10pt",
            "font-weight": "400",
            "line-height": "120%",
            "margin-top": "6pt",
            "padding-left": "36pt",
            "text-align": "justify",
            "text-indent": "-18pt"
          },
          "table": null,
          "text": "•Developer Platform: delivers a fully managed AI development platform, through Vertex AI, for accessing, tuning, augmenting, and deploying custom models and agents, helping customers build applications with more than 200 foundation models, including our Gemini family, third-party, and open models.",
          "text_hash": "5f81eec2151b7b665873c241aa73b87c91d0557cc905ec1df3cd2ba8a3a22edd",
          "type": "paragraph"
        },
        {
          "block_id": "block-000102-b7d3b9a6",
          "dom_path": "/html/body/div[114]",
          "image_asset_id": null,
          "layout_role": null,
          "ordinal": 102,
          "reported_page": 6,
          "source_anchor": "i6be430fe3ebf411481dcec8b0abe9149_19",
          "style_signature": {
            "font-family": "'arial',sans-serif",
            "font-size": "10pt",
            "font-weight": "400",
            "line-height": "120%",
            "margin-top": "6pt",
            "padding-left": "36pt",
            "text-align": "justify",
            "text-indent": "-18pt"
          },
          "table": null,
          "text": "•Cybersecurity: provides AI-powered threat intelligence and cybersecurity solutions to help customers detect, analyze, protect against, and respond to a broad range of cybersecurity threats.",
          "text_hash": "b7d3b9a6471cfa7c3c2381935d1e6fd53ba0b92110187f0b4d1ce3ed8a9aec6b",
          "type": "paragraph"
        },
        {
          "block_id": "block-000103-2b3eb887",
          "dom_path": "/html/body/div[115]",
          "image_asset_id": null,
          "layout_role": null,
          "ordinal": 103,
          "reported_page": 6,
          "source_anchor": "i6be430fe3ebf411481dcec8b0abe9149_19",
          "style_signature": {
            "font-family": "'arial',sans-serif",
            "font-size": "10pt",
            "font-weight": "400",
            "line-height": "120%",
            "margin-top": "6pt",
            "padding-left": "36pt",
            "text-align": "justify",
            "text-indent": "-18pt"
          },
          "table": null,
          "text": "•Data and Analytics: enables customers to migrate, clean, prepare, and feed data into their models. Our data platform also unifies data lakes, data warehouses, data governance, and advanced machine learning into a single platform that helps users analyze data using AI models across any cloud.",
          "text_hash": "2b3eb887fcb2fec84c6dce7958fe9ad1333ee09f9bdf74f3f53606a40856b672",
          "type": "paragraph"
        },
        {
